{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_050jul_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_050jul_6000_situation", "source_sha256": "eae862cd25355eda091a5a519cc33b96a440b20a66c1a3a1ddcc4f519ccb9490", "ja": "PR動画の撮影　休憩中", "zh": "宣传视频的拍摄　休息中", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_050jul_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_050jul_6000_place", "source_sha256": "d58c12e4ef17bb145955247cfb59b2a6f2b70430b441efd7000b41795abf3041", "ja": "ウサギのテーマパーク", "zh": "兔子主题乐园", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_050jul_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_050jul_6001_p", "source_sha256": "deae63f0fac7ad2866d3d3441b029903aa35f4d34817d8b83836b4a58ceb7b6f", "ja": "（グラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の企画で、ジュリアが\nウサギのテーマパークをPRすることになった！）", "zh": "（在写真杂志《アイグラ！！》的企划中，茱莉亚要为兔子主题乐园做宣传！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_050jul_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_050jul_6002_p", "source_sha256": "9710b09815bd2fe702d4157a6a404d6598871b82f05e16ecbc35f7fb6b6a5ab6", "ja": "お疲れ、ジュリア。\n撮影、順調じゃないか！", "zh": "辛苦了，茱莉亚。\n拍摄进行得很顺利嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_050jul_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_050jul_6003_050jul", "source_sha256": "57056168a5b66694de6fac4fd18102580d6e270f8b58615638a2ae9b5d99fe20", "ja": "はー……。そういう仕事は何度もやってきたし、慣れた\nと思ったんだけど。……まだまだハードルは高いな。", "zh": "哈……这种工作也做过很多次了，本来以为自己已经习惯了。……看来还是很有难度啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_050jul_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_050jul_6004_p", "source_sha256": "b60fb35f99ef66815fb989fe211a667d06a3da15d20700d6d9866897b90115a4", "ja": "そうか？　さっきのグラビア撮影もよかったぞ！\nウサギのポーズとか可愛かったな。", "zh": "是吗？刚才的写真拍摄也很不错啊！摆出兔子姿势的时候很可爱。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_050jul_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_050jul_6005_050jul", "source_sha256": "b27b1826f018921cb22c3bdf66341a3fe786b9e538b59887a2926e85ef8ceede", "ja": "そ、そりゃ仕事だからちゃんとやるさ。恥ずかしいって\nだけで、撮影を止めるわけにはいかないだろ？", "zh": "这、这不是因为是工作嘛，当然得好好做了。总不能因为害羞，就停下拍摄吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_050jul_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_050jul_6006_p", "source_sha256": "0fa6f1e35935bb014eae988c3a6c6a2a4a4bd036b0f7a7086fc599fe32ba03ac", "ja": "ははっ、そうだな。休憩の後は、\nPR動画の撮影だけど……そっちも大丈夫そうか？", "zh": "哈哈，说得也是。休息之后要拍宣传视频……那边也没问题吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_050jul_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_050jul_6007_050jul", "source_sha256": "9c6d7fcd9c6b6ec1450ceee3a8a703371749fa36922d01359ff7c99a157a3421", "ja": "あ、そうだった。\n動画の件で、あんたに相談しようと思ってたんだ。", "zh": "啊，对了。\n正想跟你商量一下视频的事呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_050jul_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_050jul_6008_p", "source_sha256": "ac6fffeda21fb4f03218a50354c9a9d2b712c3a64b762e251013379f76d961f2", "ja": "相談？　何か気になることでもあったか？", "zh": "咨询？是有什么在意的事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_050jul_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_050jul_6009_050jul", "source_sha256": "36cf1ea410004790e2aedb8bb650701fe68dd116fe6c23c1ddaae087b1c92c6b", "ja": "ああ。ただ普通にPRしても、面白くないと思ってさ。\nどうせなら即興で何か歌ってみようかなって。", "zh": "嗯。只是普通地做宣传，总觉得没什么意思。\n所以我想，既然要做，不如即兴唱点什么。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_050jul_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_050jul_6010_050jul", "source_sha256": "1b54cd65aeccf87865086554f8910be1bc40dc2d1b9c6872a8ea7fb93f544d7d", "ja": "でも、どんな歌がいいか決めかねてて……。\nここのPRソング……どんな曲がいいと思う？", "zh": "不过，我还拿不定主意该唱什么歌……\n你觉得这里的宣传歌……唱什么样的曲子好呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_050jul_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_050jul_6011", "source_sha256": "8437e124db7310121a44281a967f398a90a8b20dc8794d73273be4902d95bf6f", "ja": "ロックで！", "zh": "用摇滚风！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_050jul_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_050jul_6012", "source_sha256": "b959f5ab598cf9835c1948e8aef657f53c2afc9e4365720eafd1d5635b4139a3", "ja": "ポップで！", "zh": "要更流行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_050jul_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_050jul_6013", "source_sha256": "1d2ae2b1a881ce9ecbfa64c833b3c3a2051b1aeb8c700882a79de799c0d3320b", "ja": "ラップで！", "zh": "用说唱！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_050jul_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_050jul_6100_p", "source_sha256": "739ec149368c8b54db0e2e2289f1bde6ffb5e269a33531d297d16ddd8c5951ed", "ja": "せっかくジュリアがPRするんだから、\nやっぱりカッコよくて熱い曲がいいんじゃないか？", "zh": "难得要由茱莉亚来宣传，果然还是选又帅又热血的歌比较好吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_050jul_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_050jul_6101_050jul", "source_sha256": "b075606340df7eb0272828c49a3ef404ce6b3a7a410e39ceb8259a6d89810afa", "ja": "ロックってことか……。ははっ、そうだな。\nあたしの仕事なんだし、あたしらしい曲がいいよな。", "zh": "你是说摇滚吗……哈哈，说得也是。\n既然是我的工作，还是适合我的歌比较好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_050jul_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_050jul_6102_050jul", "source_sha256": "09c6a7582a01a7df1fe0dd6a00871243a918c2c9d1bd6de725ec5fc3fd8612ac", "ja": "ウサギとロック……疾走感……。うん、なんか\nいい感じにイメージが湧いてきたよ！　サンキュー♪", "zh": "兔子与摇滚……还有速度感……嗯，总觉得灵感一下子涌出来了！谢啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_050jul_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_050jul_6200_p", "source_sha256": "b6046219d98741f5eb6593fafd8c44b94d8b29c039abc64da963da3f24169df2", "ja": "それなら、ウサギの可愛いイメージに合わせて、\nキュートでポップな曲がいいんじゃないか？", "zh": "既然这样，配合兔子可爱的形象，创作一首可爱又活泼的歌曲不是更好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_050jul_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_050jul_6201_050jul", "source_sha256": "220b8d477636efafad3921bf2fae126e0032dc0e641e3a08898ad05d4d7d4ee1", "ja": "言われてみれば……。テーマパークのPRだし、\n子どもとか家族連れを意識した方がよさそうだな。", "zh": "你这么一说……确实，是主题乐园的宣传，\n看来得多考虑考虑小孩子和家庭客群才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_050jul_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_050jul_6202_050jul", "source_sha256": "7bc0c971892d1875ef9f17959282f248c700cf8a87bdbfb3c384ad5636f4146e", "ja": "ポップでカワイイ……ウサギがぴょんぴょん……？\nんー……集中したいから、少しひとりにしてくれ。", "zh": "流行又可爱……兔子蹦蹦跳跳……？\n嗯——……我想集中精神，先让我一个人待会儿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_050jul_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_050jul_6300_p", "source_sha256": "d3a017bc6934e4812dd9f1ae95fd226d5ecd04df74fe7ceb7c805ca256742866", "ja": "PRをするんだからインパクト重視でいこう！\nそう。ラップとか！", "zh": "既然是做宣传，就重视冲击力来做吧！\n对。比如Rap什么的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_050jul_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_050jul_6301_050jul", "source_sha256": "2897e6a1ec2c33b6e952b5a625a63588933ea72e9df70c9e2b371a1f6e643764", "ja": "はっ？　ラップ？\n確かに印象には残りそうだけど、ラップか……。", "zh": "哈？说唱？\n确实会给人留下印象，可说唱啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_050jul_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_050jul_6302_050jul", "source_sha256": "4f438b5d8b281da965533b754a050c800487fb2f05cdaae769f9c3a1f247a6d8", "ja": "……って、すぐ浮かぶわけないだろっ！\nこんな状態で即興なんてできるか。ナシだ、ナシ！", "zh": "……这种事哪能马上就想出来啊！\n在这种状态下怎么可能即兴得出来。不要，这个不行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
